bluejetty:00121736:ios.description:
The ND Lottery Players Club mobile app makes playing the lottery even more fun, exciting, and convenient with all the possibilities at your fingertips! Designed with players in mind, the ND Lottery Players Club mobile app offers ease and convenience for your on-the-go lifestyle. Buy a Pick & Click online play for as many games as you want, as often as you want! Use the SCAN TICKET feature to scan your tickets to see if you won, how much you won, and earn points ALL-IN-ONE scan.
The ND Lottery Players Club mobile app allows you to:
• Buy your favorite draw games with Pick & Click;
• Scan tickets to see how much you won;
• Scan to enter tickets to collect points;
• Use points shop the Points for Prizes® storefront;
• Use points to enter Points for Drawings™;
• Save ePlayslips to easily play your numbers;
• Find the nearest retailer any time;
• Receive Push Notifications for latest Lottery news;
• Manage your Players Club account; and
• View drawing results of your favorite draw games.
Forgot to buy a ticket for that huge jackpot? Time running out? No worries! Buy a ticket from anywhere in North Dakota right from your mobile device! NEVER MISS A DRAWING AGAIN!
A ticket checker in your pocket? YES!
No long codes to type? YES!
The ND Lottery Players Club mobile app will get your mind racing to IMAGINE THE POSSIBILITIES!
An internet connection is required for access to most features. 
Please note: every effort has been made to ensure the information in this application is accurate; however, in the event of a discrepancy, the winning numbers and prize amounts in the official records of the North Dakota Lottery shall prevail.
The North Dakota Lottery encourages players to be responsible in their amount of play. Do not spend more than you can afford on any lottery product. Remember, it's just a game. If gambling is no longer fun call 2-1-1 or contact GamblerND (https://gamblernd.com/) in North Dakota or Gamblers Anonymous (https://www.gamblersanonymous.org/).
Players must be at least 18 years of age to purchase and/or redeem lottery tickets.

